03062/cyber-crime/extortion-group-claims-theft-of-nearly-one-billion-expedia-traveler-records.html","2026-11-14T16:46:26.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/ef2b2b57fb06e54f.webp","/dailyinfo/media/2adef5b1e4357a03.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/ef2b2b57fb06e54f.webp 96w","q62rs7r8pongzx30vtu5q3hx7","美国政府中断 North Korean FaceStealer 活动，查获超 4 亿美元加密资产盗取","美国政府查获基础设施并中断 North Korean 社会工程活动 FaceStealer，该活动持续 18 个月，针对加密货币、Web3 行业及开源开发者，盗取超过 $400 million 加密资产。","https://www.bleepingcomputer.com/news/security/us-disrupts-north-korean-campaign-behind-400-million-crypto-theft/","2026-11-14T15:15:49.000Z","漏洞与在野利用",[172],{"_139":110,"_47":90,"_133":173,"_143":160,"_145":174,"_147":175,"_149":163,"_151":164,"_153":154,"_155":156},"CISA 将 UnrealIRCd 命令注入漏洞 CVE-2026-114713 和 Check Point 本地提权漏洞 CVE-2026-123039 加入 KEV 目录，确认均已被真实利用，并要求联邦机构在 2026 年 11 月 16 日前完成处置。","https://securityaffairs.com/203040/hacking/u-s-cisa-adds-check-point-and-unrealircd-flaws-to-its-known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog.html","2026-11-14T09:08:00.000Z",{"_139":165,"_47":166,"_133":167,"_143":144,"_145":168,"_147":169,"_149":150,"_151":152,"_153":154,"_155":156},{"_139":157,"_47":158,"_133":159,"_143":160,"_145":161,"_147":162,"_149":163,"_151":164,"_153":154,"_155":156},{"_139":140,"_47":141,"_133":142,"_143":144,"_145":146,"_147":148,"_149":150,"_151":152,"_153":154,"_155":156},"leadParagraph",{"_181":182,"_183":-5},"changelogVersion","2026-10-01T08:00","release"]
